<footer class="site-footer">
    @* as the app's SiteFooter: Browse All's speech side credits the speech corpus *@
    @if (ViewData["Speech"] != null)
    {
        <span>
            The speech corpus is led and maintained by Chris Bartley as part of doctoral research into speech technology
            for endangered languages at the University of Sheffield (<a href="https://chris-sj-bartley.github.io/">read more</a>).
            Incorporated into the Manx Corpus in collaboration with <a href="https://github.com/david-allison">David Allison</a>.<br/>
            With thanks to all the creators of the original recordings.
        </span>
    }
    else
    {
        <span>
            Maintained by David Allison · <a href="/speech">Speech corpus</a> by Chris Bartley<br/>
            With thanks to <a href="/contributions">all the volunteers</a> who transcribe, translate &amp; contribute texts.
        </span>
    }
    <span><a href="https://github.com/david-allison/manx-corpus-search">Free &amp; open source on GitHub</a></span>
</footer>
